{"title":"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of these five numbers is the largest?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/8/8088e21f639d2e53461f8f765424fff0c8787e10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 13579+\\frac{1}{2468} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 13579-\\frac{1}{2468} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 13579\\times \\frac{1}{2468}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"480\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac46617279aa625233c1d80c8261bb10ac331d22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)}\\ 13579\\div \\frac{1}{2468} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 13579.2468$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"291\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Choices (A) and (E) are slightly more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1ad810655ee23395472c65b57cb9d99f6b59e11c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13579$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Choice (B) is slightly less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1ad810655ee23395472c65b57cb9d99f6b59e11c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13579$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Choice (C), which is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/3860ca1940875b1051b521d40e92b7561e9648c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{13579}{2468}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"51\" height=\"38\" />, is much less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1ad810655ee23395472c65b57cb9d99f6b59e11c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13579$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Choice (D), which is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/0/310948ed9f3a644bf275796529311cc740520cf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13597 \\times 2468$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"15\" />, is much larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1ad810655ee23395472c65b57cb9d99f6b59e11c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13579$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/6/0e6b1a1b2bb7cc1e1168d32f6015a9ce31aed97d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 13579\\div \\frac{1}{2468}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"156\" height=\"49\" /> is by far the largest of the answer choices.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME\" title=\"1990 AJHSME\">1990 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.p